{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0494_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5aeeb99200ee23aca2383348b983201f702ec2848658ebe4bb6c87e5e77179a5", "ja": "（可愛さや華やかさは残しつつも、\n爽やかな衣装が完成した。可憐の反応はどうかな？）", "zh": "（保留了可爱与华丽感，\n清爽的服装完成了。可怜会有什么反应呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0494_1001_045kar", "source_sha256": "12bf36dcf73bee1b8b12cf9a91ee6d34278a0ba34cccd155f6b563936bf891c7", "ja": "と、とっても涼やかで、素敵ですね……！\nダンスが上手にできたら、綺麗に見えそう……♪", "zh": "这、这身衣服好清爽，真漂亮……！\n要是能把舞跳好的话，看起来一定会很美……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0494_1002_045kar", "source_sha256": "d22752bceabf23a708baf6b14a63f3e1d052c648afb601c6ffbce2defe7e5410", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さん……。\nこの後、レッスンの予定って、確認できますか……？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生……\n在这之后，能帮我确认一下练习的安排吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0494_1003_p", "source_sha256": "e36b61ed8aae5476f0dced529c3061a12ddbf6915d0fa2377367b43ddb723383", "ja": "ああ。それは構わないけど、何かしたいのか？", "zh": "啊，没问题，不过你是有什么想做的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0494_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "04490c976c660b1aef3ffcd278a9ced2d76524648e3fd3762a4554654ab42391", "ja": "はい。その、パンツスタイルの衣装ですから……\nどんな風に見えるのか、確認しておきたくて……。", "zh": "是的。那个，因为这是裤装……\n所以我想先确认一下，穿起来会是什么样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0494_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "4659f4d35505c75dced1864e677a62179e83b4c3c7980ce8a7b2d9cbb49212fb", "ja": "動き方も、いつもと変えたほうがいいかもとか……\nい、衣装に合わせたいなって思って……。", "zh": "动作方式或许也该和以往有所不同……\n我、我是想配合这套服装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0494_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d03e84121139deeb8cca463315eeb324b31728ab030d619846c789692174f329", "ja": "なるほど。わかった、あとでレッスンルームの\n状況を確認しておくよ。", "zh": "原来如此。我明白了，之后我会确认一下练习室的情况。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0494_1007_045kar", "source_sha256": "8c0e286ecd116426cbb938c8b69822d55996457a61c911a3605d13849057551f", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます……♪\nすみません、急に、わがままを言って……。", "zh": "啊，谢谢您……♪\n对不起，突然提出这么任性的要求……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0494_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d14463605f13a25c2d288a07049d6e0f62b14ac3110b21ca2de5ef03502dd7f5", "ja": "いや、構わないよ。衣装について、\n真剣に考えてくれてるんだ。喜んで協力するよ。", "zh": "不，没关系。你正在认真考虑服装的事，我很乐意帮忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0494_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
